--[[
	Hack Others — ESP Superpower (single script)
	Place in: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts  (as a LocalScript)

	Controls
	  Q  (or gamepad Y)  – turn ESP on / off
	  M                  – open / close the ESP menu
	  Eye button (bottom-right) – open / close the menu (works on mobile)

	ESP stays on until you turn it off. No timer, no cooldown.

	To lock the power for a player, set on the server:
	  player:SetAttribute("HasESP", false)   -- hides the button, turns ESP off
	  player:SetAttribute("HasESP", true)    -- gives it back
]]

